# Trained model artifacts produced by local runs
final_model.pt
final_model.int8.ptz

# Autoresearch harness: experiments/ is partially tracked.
#   - env.sh / plan.md / train_gpt.py / result.json / modules/  → tracked
#     (so Mac and Pod stay in sync on what was queued + what came back).
#   - run.log / logs/ / final_model.* / __pycache__   → ignored per below
#     (heavy generated artifacts; reproducible from the tracked files).
# Pre-RunPod note: the prior MPS workflow had `experiments/` blanket-ignored;
# the existing local experiment dirs from that era are now visible to git
# status as untracked. Add only the specific NNNN_<slug>/ you're working on
# (`git add experiments/NNNN_<slug>`); never `git add -A` from repo root.
experiments/*/run.log
experiments/*/logs/
experiments/*/final_model.pt
experiments/*/final_model.int8.ptz
experiments/*/__pycache__/
experiments/*/modules/__pycache__/

# Ephemeral scratch space the agent uses for derivations, profiling, etc.
scratch/

# Curl-on-demand vendoring of upstream SSM repos (see references/INDEX.md)
references/_external/
# Local-only research artifacts: agent-curated reading list, vendored paper PDFs,
# and the local index over them. Vendored Python (mamba_minimal_model.py,
# selective_scan_ref.py) stays tracked.
PAPERS.md
references/INDEX.md
references/*.pdf
walks/

# Ephemeral runtime state from the scheduling/loop machinery
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
